Dear Partner,

As the festive season is upon us, we at Marasa Africa Kenya would like to
take a moment to wish you a very *Merry Christmas* and a *Happy New Year
2025*!

We are incredibly grateful for the trust and support you have extended to
us throughout the year. Your partnership has been instrumental in making
2024 a remarkable year, and we sincerely thank you for the good business
you have sent our way.

Looking ahead, we are optimistic that 2025 will be an even better year for
all of us. Exciting things are on the horizon, and we look forward to
sharing more updates with you as the year unfolds.

We also take this opportunity to humbly acknowledge that we may not have
fully met the expectations of some of our partners this year. Please accept
our heartfelt apologies for any shortfalls. Rest assured, we are committed
to making things right, and 2025 will be a year of growth, improvement, and
strengthened collaboration.

Please click on the link here to check on availability during this festive
period marasa availability
<https://docs.google.com/spreadsheets/d/1hmmXbA52OP94myko3QQ97JxRSyWW5kHqo0xBeawOmj0/edit?gid=0#gid=0>

https://docs.google.com/spreadsheets/d/1hmmXbA52OP94myko3QQ97JxRSyWW5kHqo0xBeawOmj0/edit?gid=0#gid=0

Thank you for being an essential part of the Marasa Africa Kenya journey.
Wishing you and your loved ones a joyous festive season and a prosperous
New Year


Kind regards


*Mike Mutiga*

